    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resonance Tales: Alone</strong> is a <strong>first-person psychological horror experience</strong> centered around <strong>atmosphere, tension, and introspective storytelling</strong>. You don\u2019t fight to survive \u2014 you move to understand. Step into a symbolic, dreamlike space where reality blurs with memory and fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just fragments of a story told through shadows, rooms, and the way you move through them. You\u2019re not solving puzzles \u2014 you\u2019re piecing yourself together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person exploration with a psychological edge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized 3D visuals with surreal and haunting spaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative told through environments, not exposition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtle mechanics, heavy atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every detail has weight \u2014 even silence</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It won\u2019t tell you what\u2019s happening. But it\u2019ll make you <i>feel</i> it.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resonance Tales: Alone</strong> is a <strong>first-person psychological horror experience</strong> centered around <strong>atmosphere, tension, and introspective storytelling</strong>. You don\u2019t fight to survive \u2014 you move to understand. Step into a symbolic, dreamlike space where reality blurs with memory and fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just fragments of a story told through shadows, rooms, and the way you move through them. You\u2019re not solving puzzles \u2014 you\u2019re piecing yourself together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person exploration with a psychological edge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized 3D visuals with surreal and haunting spaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative told through environments, not exposition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtle mechanics, heavy atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every detail has weight \u2014 even silence</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It won\u2019t tell you what\u2019s happening. But it\u2019ll make you <i>feel</i> it.</p>",
